The cv_distance tie-breaker summed over the arguments; now one candidate
dominates another only if it is not worse for any argument (cv_per_argument
from fargs.match).  g++ 13 ("call of overloaded 'f(int&)' is ambiguous") and
clang++ 18 reject this program.
